      "side": 1,
      "message": "The rust team recommended to use `Box\u003c[u8]\u003e` to signal users of fixed size in another cl, should we consider using it here?\n\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Virtualization/+/2778936/comment/54bd2396_37a19bee/",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
